  speakerName: Mr Watson
  characterAvatar: {fileID: 0}
  arrivalPrompt: "As a choirster in 1970s, a lifetime of memories about Cathedral
    stays with Mr Watson. Later as a teacher, he brought students to visit the Cathedral
    every year, always reminding them to look for the spire if they ever got lost\nAfter
    the Cathedral was closed, Mr Watson continues to follow its restoreration closely.
    He knows its stories intimately \u2014 and believes that even its stones have
    stories to tell."
  arrivalButtonText: Meet the Storyteller
  dialogueLines:
  - ' '
  - My experience in the choir had a profound impact on my life. I learned to play
    the organ, and I still play for services at local churches today.
  - ' '
  - ' '
